# The build panel's food toggles place a building site of their type: a fisher and a pig farm (small buildings) and a farm (a large
# building, which needs the site of a large building) on a map with the castle placed. Each site shows as the original draws a site
# that has not started; the list holds the site's needs and target height.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1, under either graphics source:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh food-sites --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --fps 10
#   sh tools/play-run.sh food-sites --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --fps 10 --graphics open-settlers
# On that map the castle stands at 21,4, so its flag is at 22,5. Each building brings its flag south-east of it.
expect seed = 1234567812345678
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 21 4
wait 0.3

button Fisher
click-tile 26 4
button Fisher
button Pig farm
click-tile 22 7
button Pig farm
button Farm
click-tile 23 1
button Farm
wait 0.3
expect-at 26 4 building
expect-at 22 7 building
expect-at 23 1 building
expect-count building = 4
shot food-sites 22 4 6 2
list food-sites
dump food-sites

# A farm on a small site is refused: the node 22,3 holds a site for a small building only.
button Farm
click-tile 22 3
button Farm
wait 0.3
expect-count building = 4
